posts.body:
Ran into the same crash testing out the plugin.
Seems like the missing function call is this.maskName inside of a VisuMZ.ItemCraftingSys function
but maskName is a function in the Window_ItemCraftingList class and not whatever the
VisuMZ.ItemCraftingSys class is.
A quick fix is to just add the maskName function to VisuMZ.ItemCraftingSys
VisuMZ.ItemCraftingSys.maskName = function (_0x32b0e8) {
if (Imported.VisuMZ_1_MessageCore && TextManager.parseLocalizedText) {
_0x32b0e8 = TextManager.parseLocalizedText(_0x32b0e8);
}
return Array(_0x32b0e8.length + 0x1).join(TextManager.itemCraftingMask);
};
or revert to an earlier version like 1.21
